    "titel": "Irland, Österreich, Slowenien – Beratung im Bereich Forschung und Entwicklung – ATU wishes to establish a Panel of National Contact Point Experts across EU Member States to build capacity to incorporate EU Results-Based Payments Schemes in Public or Private Support Schemes.",
